  "captions": [
    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "editorial", "start_seconds": 0.05, "end_seconds": 8.5, "text": "МОЖЕТ ЛИ СВЯЗЬ", "font": "nikulinaCondensed", "size": 82, "weight": 700, "color": "#F7F4EF", "case": "upper", "x": -90, "y": -620, "animation": "fade-slide-up", "animation_duration_frames": 10, "slide_distance_px": 12, "fade_out_frames": 7 },
    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "editorial", "start_seconds": 0.18, "end_seconds": 8.5, "text": "БЫТЬ ЦЕННОЙ", "font": "nikulinaCondensed", "size": 92, "weight": 700, "color": "#F7F4EF", "case": "upper", "x": -15, "y": -498, "animation": "fade-slide-up", "animation_duration_frames": 10, "slide_distance_px": 12, "fade_out_frames": 7 },
    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "editorial", "start_seconds": 0.31, "end_seconds": 8.5, "text": "БЕЗ БУДУЩЕГО?", "font": "nikulinaCondensed", "size": 88, "weight": 700, "color": "#F7F4EF", "case": "upper", "x": 45, "y": -378, "animation": "fade-slide-up", "animation_duration_frames": 10, "slide_distance_px": 12, "fade_out_frames": 7 },

    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "q-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-question-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 18.42, "text": "Ты когда-нибудь ловила себя на том, что воспринимаешь каждую романтическую связь", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 45, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 420, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "q-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-question-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 18.42, "text": "слишком серьёзно и берёшь на себя слишком много ответственности, настолько,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 45, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 480, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "q-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-question-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 18.42, "text": "что не можешь просто встречаться с кем-то, ходить на свидания", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 45, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 540, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "q-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-question-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 18.42, "text": "или заниматься любовью без чувства вины и груза ответственности,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 45, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 600, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "q-g2", "translation_group_id": "r02-question-g2", "start_seconds": 18.66, "end_seconds": 23.18, "text": "особенно когда с самого начала понимаешь,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 54, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 510, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "question", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "q-g2", "translation_group_id": "r02-question-g2", "start_seconds": 18.66, "end_seconds": 23.18, "text": "что общего будущего нет?", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 58, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 575, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },

    { "sequence_id": "context", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "c-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-unique-value-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 7.32, "text": "Это очень... на самом деле потакание тому удовольствию:", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 50, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 465, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "context", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "c-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-unique-value-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 7.32, "text": "встретить кого-то, сделать его день лучше,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 52, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 525, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "context", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "c-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-unique-value-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 7.32, "text": "его неделю лучше, его месяц лучше,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 54, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 585, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "context", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "c-g2", "translation_group_id": "r02-unique-value-g2", "start_seconds": 7.76, "end_seconds": 10.9, "text": "дать ему опыт, которого у него", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 56, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 515, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "context", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "c-g2", "translation_group_id": "r02-unique-value-g2", "start_seconds": 7.76, "end_seconds": 10.9, "text": "никогда раньше не было,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 58, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 580, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "context", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "c-g3", "translation_group_id": "r02-unique-value-g3", "start_seconds": 11.32, "end_seconds": 20.48, "text": "потому что это не обязательно должен быть невероятный опыт,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 50, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 470, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "context", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "c-g3", "translation_group_id": "r02-unique-value-g3", "start_seconds": 11.32, "end_seconds": 20.48, "text": "который можешь дать только ты,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 54, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 530, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "context", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "c-g3", "translation_group_id": "r02-unique-value-g3", "start_seconds": 11.32, "end_seconds": 20.48, "text": "но ты и этот один человек вместе, совершенно уникальны.", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 52, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 590, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },

    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "p-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-permission-payoff-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 3.52, "text": "Иди устанавливай связи с людьми,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 56, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 515, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "p-g1", "translation_group_id": "r02-permission-payoff-g1", "start_seconds": 0, "end_seconds": 3.52, "text": "иди переживай мимолётные моменты удовольствия.", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 52, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 580, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "p-g2", "translation_group_id": "r02-permission-payoff-g2", "start_seconds": 3.52, "end_seconds": 15.32, "text": "Не чувствуй давления или ожиданий,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 52, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 430, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "p-g2", "translation_group_id": "r02-permission-payoff-g2", "start_seconds": 3.52, "end_seconds": 15.32, "text": "пока у тебя добрые намерения и ты не собираешься кому-то навредить,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 46, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 490, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "p-g2", "translation_group_id": "r02-permission-payoff-g2", "start_seconds": 3.52, "end_seconds": 15.32, "text": "если только это не их кинк, и у тебя есть их согласие,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 48, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 550, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "p-g2", "translation_group_id": "r02-permission-payoff-g2", "start_seconds": 3.52, "end_seconds": 15.32, "text": "и это то, чего они хотят.", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 54, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 610, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "p-g3", "translation_group_id": "r02-permission-payoff-g3", "start_seconds": 15.96, "end_seconds": 22.16, "text": "Тогда у тебя добрые намерения,", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 56, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 520, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "speech", "phrase_id": "p-g3", "translation_group_id": "r02-permission-payoff-g3", "start_seconds": 15.96, "end_seconds": 22.16, "text": "ты входишь во что-то лёгкое без всяких ожиданий.", "font": "nikulinaSans", "size": 52, "weight": 600, "color": "#F7F4EF", "x": 0, "y": 585, "shadow": [{ "y": 3, "blur": 18, "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)" }] },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "editorial", "start_seconds": 18.8, "end_seconds": 22.16, "text": "ЛЕГКО. ЧЕСТНО.", "font": "nikulinaCondensed", "size": 76, "weight": 700, "color": "#F7F4EF", "case": "upper", "x": -105, "y": -545, "animation": "fade-slide-up", "animation_duration_frames": 9, "slide_distance_px": 10, "fade_out_frames": 0 },
    { "sequence_id": "payoff", "role": "editorial", "start_seconds": 19.0, "end_seconds": 22.16, "text": "БЕЗ ЛОЖНЫХ ОБЕЩАНИЙ.", "font": "nikulinaCondensed", "size": 64, "weight": 700, "color": "#F7F4EF", "case": "upper", "x": 0, "y": -430, "animation": "fade-slide-up", "animation_duration_frames": 9, "slide_distance_px": 10, "fade_out_frames": 0 }
  ],
